{"number":77,"nameArabic":"المرسلات","nameTransliterated":"Al-Mursalat","nameTranslated":"The Emissaries","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":50,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"77:1","textAr":"وَٱلۡمُرۡسَلَٰتِ عُرۡفٗا","transliteration":"Waalmursalati AAurfan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By those [winds] sent forth in gusts"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے اُن (ہواؤں) کی جو پے در پے بھیجی جاتی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"77:2","textAr":"فَٱلۡعَٰصِفَٰتِ عَصۡفٗا","transliteration":"FaalAAasifati AAasfan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the winds that blow violently"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر طوفانی رفتار سے چلتی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"77:3","textAr":"وَٱلنَّـٰشِرَٰتِ نَشۡرٗا","transliteration":"Waalnnashirati nashran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] the winds that spread [clouds]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور (بادلوں کو) اٹھا کر پھیلاتی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"77:4","textAr":"فَٱلۡفَٰرِقَٰتِ فَرۡقٗا","transliteration":"Faalfariqati farqan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And those [angels] who bring criterion"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (اُن کو) پھاڑ کر جدا کرتی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"77:5","textAr":"فَٱلۡمُلۡقِيَٰتِ ذِكۡرًا","transliteration":"Faalmulqiyati thikran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And those [angels] who deliver a message"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (دلوں میں خدا کی) یاد ڈالتی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"77:6","textAr":"عُذۡرًا أَوۡ نُذۡرًا","transliteration":"AAuthran aw nuthran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As justification or warning"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"عذر کے طور پر یا ڈراوے کے طور پر"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"77:7","textAr":"إِنَّمَا تُوعَدُونَ لَوَٰقِعٞ","transliteration":"Innama tooAAadoona lawaqiAAun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, what you are promised is to occur"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس چیز کا تم سے وعدہ کیا جا رہا ہے وہ ضرور واقع ہونے والی ہے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"77:8","textAr":"فَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ طُمِسَتۡ","transliteration":"Faitha alnnujoomu tumisat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So when the stars are obliterated"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر جب ستارے ماند پڑ جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"77:9","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ فُرِجَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alssamao furijat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the heaven is opened"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور آسمان پھاڑ دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"77:10","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجِبَالُ نُسِفَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha aljibalu nusifat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the mountains are blown away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پہاڑ دھنک ڈالے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"77:11","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلرُّسُلُ أُقِّتَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alrrusulu oqqitat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the messengers' time has come"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور رسولوں کی حاضری کا وقت آ پہنچے گا (اس روز وہ چیز واقع ہو جائے گی)"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"77:12","textAr":"لِأَيِّ يَوۡمٍ أُجِّلَتۡ","transliteration":"Liayyi yawmin ojjilat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For what Day was it postponed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کس روز کے لیے یہ کام اٹھا رکھا گیا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"77:13","textAr":"لِيَوۡمِ ٱلۡفَصۡلِ","transliteration":"Liyawmi alfasli","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For the Day of Judgement"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"فیصلے کے روز کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"77:14","textAr":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا يَوۡمُ ٱلۡفَصۡلِ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma yawmu alfasli","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Judgement"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہیں کیا خبر کہ وہ فیصلے کا دن کیا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"77:15","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس دن جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"77:16","textAr":"أَلَمۡ نُهۡلِكِ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"Alam nuhliki alawwaleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Did We not destroy the former peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا ہم نے اگلوں کو ہلاک نہیں کیا؟"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"77:17","textAr":"ثُمَّ نُتۡبِعُهُمُ ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","transliteration":"Thumma nutbiAAuhumu alakhireena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then We will follow them with the later ones"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اُنہی کے پیچھے ہم بعد والوں کو چلتا کریں گے"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"77:18","textAr":"كَذَٰلِكَ نَفۡعَلُ بِٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","transliteration":"Kathalika nafAAalu bialmujrimeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Thus do We deal with the criminals"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مجرموں کے ساتھ ہم یہی کچھ کیا کرتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"77:19","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس دن جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"77:20","textAr":"أَلَمۡ نَخۡلُقكُّم مِّن مَّآءٖ مَّهِينٖ","transliteration":"Alam nakhluqkum min main maheenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Did We not create you from a liquid disdained"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا ہم نے ایک حقیر پانی سے تمہیں پیدا نہیں کیا"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"77:21","textAr":"فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُ فِي قَرَارٖ مَّكِينٍ","transliteration":"FajaAAalnahu fee qararin makeenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And We placed it in a firm lodging"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ایک مقررہ مدت تک،"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"77:22","textAr":"إِلَىٰ قَدَرٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","transliteration":"Ila qadarin maAAloomin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For a known extent"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُسے ایک محفوظ جگہ ٹھیرائے رکھا؟"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"77:23","textAr":"فَقَدَرۡنَا فَنِعۡمَ ٱلۡقَٰدِرُونَ","transliteration":"Faqadarna faniAAma alqadiroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And We determined [it], and excellent [are We] to determine"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو دیکھو، ہم اِس پر قادر تھے، پس ہم بہت اچھی قدرت رکھنے والے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"77:24","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"77:25","textAr":"أَلَمۡ نَجۡعَلِ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ كِفَاتًا","transliteration":"Alam najAAali alarda kifatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have We not made the earth a container"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا ہم نے زمین کو سمیٹ کر رکھنے والی نہیں بنایا"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"77:26","textAr":"أَحۡيَآءٗ وَأَمۡوَٰتٗا","transliteration":"Ahyaan waamwatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Of the living and the dead"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"زندوں کے لیے بھی اور مُردوں کے لیے بھی"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"77:27","textAr":"وَجَعَلۡنَا فِيهَا رَوَٰسِيَ شَٰمِخَٰتٖ وَأَسۡقَيۡنَٰكُم مَّآءٗ فُرَاتٗا","transliteration":"WajaAAalna feeha rawasiya shamikhatin waasqaynakum maan furatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And We placed therein lofty, firmly set mountains and have given you to drink sweet water"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اس میں بلند و بالا پہاڑ جمائے، اور تمہیں میٹھا پانی پلایا؟"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"77:28","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"77:29","textAr":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓاْ إِلَىٰ مَا كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"Intaliqoo ila ma kuntum bihi tukaththiboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[They will be told], \"Proceed to that which you used to deny"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"چلو اب اُسی چیز کی طرف جسے تم جھٹلایا کرتے تھے"}]},{"ayah":30,"verseKey":"77:30","textAr":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓاْ إِلَىٰ ظِلّٖ ذِي ثَلَٰثِ شُعَبٖ","transliteration":"Intaliqoo ila thillin thee thalathi shuAAabin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"چلو اُس سائے کی طرف جو تین شاخوں والا ہے"}]},{"ayah":31,"verseKey":"77:31","textAr":"لَّا ظَلِيلٖ وَلَا يُغۡنِي مِنَ ٱللَّهَبِ","transliteration":"La thaleelin wala yughnee mina allahabi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"نہ ٹھنڈک پہنچانے والا اور نہ آگ کی لپٹ سے بچانے والا"}]},{"ayah":32,"verseKey":"77:32","textAr":"إِنَّهَا تَرۡمِي بِشَرَرٖ كَٱلۡقَصۡرِ","transliteration":"Innaha tarmee bishararin kaalqasri","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ آگ محل جیسی بڑی بڑی چنگاریاں پھینکے گی"}]},{"ayah":33,"verseKey":"77:33","textAr":"كَأَنَّهُۥ جِمَٰلَتٞ صُفۡرٞ","transliteration":"Kaannahu jimalatun sufrun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As if they were yellowish [black] camels"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(جو اچھلتی ہوئی یوں محسوس ہوں گی) گویا کہ وہ زرد اونٹ ہیں"}]},{"ayah":34,"verseKey":"77:34","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":35,"verseKey":"77:35","textAr":"هَٰذَا يَوۡمُ لَا يَنطِقُونَ","transliteration":"Hatha yawmu la yantiqoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"This is a Day they will not speak"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ وہ دن ہے جس میں وہ نہ کچھ بولیں گے"}]},{"ayah":36,"verseKey":"77:36","textAr":"وَلَا يُؤۡذَنُ لَهُمۡ فَيَعۡتَذِرُونَ","transliteration":"Wala yuthanu lahum fayaAAtathiroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Nor will it be permitted for them to make an excuse"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نہ اُنہیں موقع دیا جائے گا کہ کوئی عذر پیش کریں"}]},{"ayah":37,"verseKey":"77:37","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس دن جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":38,"verseKey":"77:38","textAr":"هَٰذَا يَوۡمُ ٱلۡفَصۡلِۖ جَمَعۡنَٰكُمۡ وَٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"Hatha yawmu alfasli jamaAAnakum waalawwaleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"This is the Day of Judgement; We will have assembled you and the former peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ فیصلے کا دن ہے ہم نے تمہیں اور تم سے پہلے گزرے ہوئے لوگوں کو جمع کر دیا ہے"}]},{"ayah":39,"verseKey":"77:39","textAr":"فَإِن كَانَ لَكُمۡ كَيۡدٞ فَكِيدُونِ","transliteration":"Fain kana lakum kaydun fakeedooni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So if you have a plan, then plan against Me"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اب اگر کوئی چال تم چل سکتے ہو تو میرے مقابلہ میں چل دیکھو"}]},{"ayah":40,"verseKey":"77:40","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس دن جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":41,"verseKey":"77:41","textAr":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ فِي ظِلَٰلٖ وَعُيُونٖ","transliteration":"Inna almuttaqeena fee thilalin waAAuyoonin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, the righteous will be among shades and springs"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"متقی لوگ آج سایوں اور چشموں میں ہیں"}]},{"ayah":42,"verseKey":"77:42","textAr":"وَفَوَٰكِهَ مِمَّا يَشۡتَهُونَ","transliteration":"Wafawakiha mimma yashtahoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And fruits from whatever they desire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جو پھل وہ چاہیں (اُن کے لیے حاضر ہیں)"}]},{"ayah":43,"verseKey":"77:43","textAr":"كُلُواْ وَٱشۡرَبُواْ هَنِيٓـَٔۢا بِمَا كُنتُمۡ تَعۡمَلُونَ","transliteration":"Kuloo waishraboo haneean bima kuntum taAAmaloona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کھاؤ اور پیو مزے سے اپنے اُن اعمال کے صلے میں جو تم کرتے رہے ہو"}]},{"ayah":44,"verseKey":"77:44","textAr":"إِنَّا كَذَٰلِكَ نَجۡزِي ٱلۡمُحۡسِنِينَ","transliteration":"Inna kathalika najzee almuhsineena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم نیک لوگوں کو ایسی ہی جزا دیتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":45,"verseKey":"77:45","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":46,"verseKey":"77:46","textAr":"كُلُواْ وَتَمَتَّعُواْ قَلِيلًا إِنَّكُم مُّجۡرِمُونَ","transliteration":"Kuloo watamattaAAoo qaleelan innakum mujrimoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[O disbelievers], eat and enjoy yourselves a little; indeed, you are criminals"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کھا لو اور مزے کر لو تھوڑے دن حقیقت میں تم لوگ مجرم ہو"}]},{"ayah":47,"verseKey":"77:47","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":48,"verseKey":"77:48","textAr":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱرۡكَعُواْ لَا يَرۡكَعُونَ","transliteration":"Waitha qeela lahumu irkaAAoo la yarkaAAoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when it is said to them, \"Bow [in prayer],\" they do not bow"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جب اِن سے کہا جاتا ہے کہ (اللہ کے آگے) جھکو تو نہیں جھکتے"}]},{"ayah":49,"verseKey":"77:49","textAr":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تباہی ہے اُس روز جھٹلانے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":50,"verseKey":"77:50","textAr":"فَبِأَيِّ حَدِيثِۭ بَعۡدَهُۥ يُؤۡمِنُونَ","transliteration":"Fabiayyi hadeethin baAAdahu yuminoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then in what statement after the Qur'an will they believe"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اب اِس (قرآن) کے بعد اور کونسا کلام ایسا ہو سکتا ہے جس پر یہ ایمان لائیں؟"}]}]}